# INSTRUCTION v2, Section 6.3) that puts Buyer Value Radar behind a
# "Score a Customer" endpoint on giggitai.com. Not wired up yet; kept here
# so the shape is documented before it exists.
# GCP_PROJECT_ID=
# GCP_REGION=
# GCP_SA_KEY_JSON=
